  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Marketing KOW</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Kingdom of WOW produces footwear and is a social brand with an in-house and responsibly run manufacturing facility. This DGGF-TA provided enabled KOW to focus on marketing and branding with the goal to increase sales so as to increase the volume of the production in Cambodia. KOW employs mainly uneducated women who have little chance to find safe and fair employment in the formal economy. Growth would mean employing more women and providing them with a living wage and opportunities for professional development. During this DGGF-TA, two people were trained on marketing and branding subjects.</narrative>
  </description>
